cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Digital Twin Engine"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Mohammadi"
    given-names: "Esmaeel"
repository-code: "https://github.com/esmaeelMhd/digital-twin-engine"
abstract: >-
  Surrogate models of industrial process systems built on physics-informed
  latent neural SDEs, in JAX. Provides uncertainty estimates from stochastic
  latent dynamics, conservation-law residuals as training losses and
  evaluation diagnostics, few-shot transfer across unit variants, and a
  shared backbone trained across several system types.
keywords:
  - surrogate modelling
  - physics-informed machine learning
  - neural stochastic differential equations
  - digital twin
  - process engineering
  - JAX
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-23"
